                "description": "1. Obtain the user pool ID from the Cognito hosted-UI login URL or from `GET /api/auth/config` (unauthenticated). 2. Construct payload `{\"sub\":\"<victim-user-id>\",\"email\":\"victim@example.com\",\"orgId\":\"<org>\",\"role\":\"owner\",\"exp\":<now+3600>}`, base64url-encode it. 3. Compute HMAC-SHA256 over the encoded data keyed with the user pool ID. 4. Send `Authorization: Bearer internal.<data>.<sig>` to any protected API route. The token is accepted and the request executes as the victim.",
