          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "Hardcoded default JWT secret enables unauthenticated token forgery in local auth mode\n\nThe local-mode JWT signing secret defaults to the hardcoded string `super-agent-local-dev-secret-change-in-production` when `JWT_SECRET` is not set. There is no runtime guard rejecting this default (or the `CHANGE_ME` placeholder) in production, so any deployment that omits the variable lets an unauthenticated attacker forge valid JWTs for arbitrary users, organizations, and roles."
