          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Unrestricted SSRF via MCP server connection test endpoint\n\nThe MCP server connection test (`POST /api/mcp/servers/:id/test`) performs a server-side `fetch()` to a fully user-controlled URL (the server's `host_address` or `config.url`) with no SSRF protections: no internal-IP denylist, no scheme restriction, and redirects followed by default. This gives any authenticated user a server-side request primitive to internal networks and cloud metadata."
          },
          "locations": [
