          "ruleId": "CWE-22",
          "ruleIndex": 10,
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "Path traversal to arbitrary file write via unvalidated skill name in workspace provisioning\n\nSkill names are never validated or sanitized. A name containing `../` (fully attacker-controlled via the skill zip upload endpoint or marketplace install reference) is joined into filesystem paths without any containment check in `WorkspaceManager.installSkillToWorkspace` and `WorkspaceManager.downloadSkill`, so skill provisioning copies attacker-controlled files (arbitrary content from the uploaded zip) to arbitrary directories outside the session workspace — an arbitrary file write with controlled content on the backend host."
