            "text": "Member-configurable stdio MCP servers allow arbitrary command execution on the backend host\n\nAny authenticated organization member can register an MCP server whose stdio configuration contains an arbitrary command, arguments, and environment variables. That configuration flows unvalidated into the Claude Agent SDK's MCP server spawn configuration, so the next agent conversation in a scope with that server attached executes the command as a subprocess of the backend server process."
