                "description": "1. Authenticate as a member of Org A. 2. Call GET /api/knowledge-bases/:id with the UUID of a knowledge base belonging to Org B — the handler calls knowledgeBaseService.findById(id) which runs prisma.knowledge_bases.findUnique({where:{id}}) with no org filter, returning the victim record. 3. Call PUT /api/knowledge-bases/:id with {name:'pwned'} — prisma update by {id} only. 4. Call DELETE /api/knowledge-bases/scope/:victimScopeId/bindings/:kbId to strip another org's bindings, or POST .../bind with arbitrary scope and KB ids to cross-link tenants. 5. DELETE /api/knowledge-bases/:victimKbId/files/:victimFileId deletes the victim file by primary key.",
