          "ruleId": "CWE-306",
          "ruleIndex": 16,
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "Unauthenticated, unscoped WebSocket gateway leaks any tenant's workflow execution events\n\nThe WebSocket endpoint `/ws/executions` accepts unauthenticated connections and allows any client to subscribe to arbitrary workflow `executionId` values with no ownership or tenant check. Workflow node events — including full node output (`result.output`, e.g. LLM responses and tool results) — are then broadcast to that client, leaking any tenant's execution data to an unauthenticated network peer."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "SECURITY.md"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "logicalLocations": [
