          "ruleId": "CWE-639",
          "ruleIndex": 13,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Cross-tenant leader manipulation in PUT /api/chat/rooms/:roomId/members/:agentId/leader (missing org scoping on raw updateMany)\n\nThe \"set room leader\" endpoint updates `chat_room_members` with raw Prisma `updateMany` filtered only by `session_id` and `agent_id` — no organization scoping and no room-ownership check — so any authenticated member-role user who knows a room's session UUID can change leader assignment and leader instructions on another organization's room."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "SECURITY.md"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "logicalLocations": [
