          "message": {
            "text": "Path traversal via packId/scopeDirName — Ruled out: Pack deploy service + routes (pack-deploy.service.ts, pack-deploy.routes.ts)\n\npackId and scopeDirName are joined into paths under the server-side industry-packs directory, but all reads are gated by `existsSync(packDir)` / `existsSync(resolvedDir)` and only directory reads (readdir of agents/skills subdirs) occur — a traversal name resolves to a non-existent directory and returns 404 before any file is parsed; no write or delete uses these inputs. Content read is limited to files inside the resolved dir via fixed names (scope.json, SKILL.md, workflow-plan.json). No containment escape is reachable because traversal requires an existing directory at the escaped path and everything is read-only."
